@@ -3,3 +3,21 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an independent, in-memory rental
+service. Register boards and sails with `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`;
+IDs must be unique and prices are nonnegative safe integers in euro cents.
+`quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the period and its total in cents.
+`book` returns the same fields plus a booking ID, and reserves the equipment.
+
+Periods use ISO-8601 UTC midnight strings (for example `2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z`)
+and include the start but exclude the end. The end must follow the start. Adjacent
+bookings are allowed; overlapping bookings for the same item are rejected.
+Quotes do not reserve equipment or check availability. State lasts only as long
+as the service instance.
+
+Cancellation is not implemented yet. When added, a cancellation less than 24 hours
+before the booking's start receives no refund; otherwise the full amount is
+refunded, including at exactly 24 hours before the start.
+
+Run `npm test` with Node.js 22.18 or later (with native TypeScript stripping).
diff --git a/src/index.ts b/src/index.ts
